---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('tenkt');
---
<AppLayout app={app} title={`Support · ${app.name}`}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="support" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="Contact" title={`Send <em>email</em>.`}>
        <p class="lede">Need help with {app.name}? Send an email to <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>. You'll get a reply from Jonas himself, usually within a day.</p>
      </Chapter>
      <Chapter num="02" label="FAQ" title={`What people <em>ask about</em>.`}>
        <p><strong>Does everyone get the same puzzles?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">Yes. Puzzles are generated from the date with a shared seed, so everyone who opens Tenkt on a given day gets exactly the same set.</p>
        <p><strong>Did I lose my streak?</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">Streaks are stored locally on the device. If you have iCloud Drive enabled, the streak syncs between your devices. Email me if you lost one and I'll see if we can recover it.</p>
        <p><strong>I found a puzzle with no solution</strong></p>
        <p class="muted">Send me the date and puzzle type and I'll investigate. The generator validates every puzzle, but if something slipped through I want to know and fix it.</p>
      </Chapter>
      <Chapter num="03" label="Feedback" title={`Ideas, <em>bugs</em>, tips.`}>
        <p>Features you miss? Bugs that annoy? Send them to the same address. I read everything and prioritize based on what actually makes the app better.</p>
      </Chapter>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Support`} />
</AppLayout>
